{"id": "es-l03", "lang": "es", "size": "long", "domain": "general", "status": "done", "reason": null, "turns": 1, "H_ms": 530.7083333333721, "release_lag_ms": 458.6, "H_minus_lag_ms": 72.1, "first_H_ms": 530.7083333333721, "tail_est_ms": 2219.9, "server_marks": {"mt_first_token": -6859.5, "mt_first_chunk": -6605.5, "tts_request": -6605.3, "tts_first_byte": -5763, "tail_tts_first_byte": 1759.6, "audio_first_sent": 1, "stt_final": 669.4}, "browser_marks": {"commit_sent": 460.2999997138977, "first_audible": 530.7083333333721}, "source": "Llegué a esta ciudad hace poco. Y todavía no tengo coche. Trabajo de noche en un restaurante. Por eso prefiero las citas por la tarde. ", "target": "I just arrived in this city. And I still don’t have a car. I work night shifts in a restaurant. That’s why I prefer appointments in the afternoon.", "reference": "I arrived in this city recently and I still don't have a car. I work nights at a restaurant. That's why I prefer afternoon appointments.", "n": 42, "t_s": 474.6}
